driver from sm8750 linux kernel 6.6 to 4.19

fork by https://github.com/youngguo18/android_kernel_OPPO_sm8250/tree/stock/13.1

edited files
   modified:   arch/arm64/configs/vendor/kona-perf_defconfig
   modified:   build.sh
   modified:   drivers/Kconfig
   modified:   drivers/hid/hid-microsoft.c
   modified:   drivers/hid/hid-nintendo.c
   modified:   drivers/hid/hid-playstation.c   （remove led support）
   modified:   drivers/hid/hid-sony.c          （ds4 support was moved to hid-playstation.c）

Note: KernelSU code is retained in the source tree, but the compilation options in defconfig have been removed.

tools
git clone --depth=1 https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_clang_kernel_linux-x86_clang-r416183b.git ~/kernel/clang
git clone --depth=1 https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_gcc_linux-x86_aarch64_aarch64-linux-android-4.9.git ~/kernel/gcc64
git clone --depth=1 https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_gcc_linux-x86_arm_arm-linux-androideabi-4.9.git ~/kernel/gcc32

run build.sh



驱动移植自 sm8750 linux kernel 6.6 到 4.19

源码 Fork 自 https://github.com/youngguo18/android_kernel_OPPO_sm8250/tree/stock/13.1

修改的文件：
   modified:   arch/arm64/configs/vendor/kona-perf_defconfig
   modified:   build.sh
   modified:   drivers/Kconfig
   modified:   drivers/hid/hid-microsoft.c
   modified:   drivers/hid/hid-nintendo.c
   modified:   drivers/hid/hid-playstation.c   （移除了 led 支持）
   modified:   drivers/hid/hid-sony.c          （ds4 的支持已移动到 hid-playstation.c）

注意：KernelSU 代码仍保留在源码树中，但已删除 defconfig 中的编译选项。

编译工具：
git clone --depth=1 https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_clang_kernel_linux-x86_clang-r416183b.git ~/kernel/clang
git clone --depth=1 https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_gcc_linux-x86_aarch64_aarch64-linux-android-4.9.git ~/kernel/gcc64
git clone --depth=1 https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_gcc_linux-x86_arm_arm-linux-androideabi-4.9.git ~/kernel/gcc32

运行 build.sh 即可编译
